  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/YPX2\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented, thoughtfully updated and filled with natural light. This much-loved three-bedroom home delivers an inviting combination of modern comfort, easy outdoor living and a wonderfully peaceful setting.\r\n\r\nDesigned for relaxed family living and effortless entertaining, the heart of the home is its light-filled open-plan living, dining and kitchen area. The contemporary kitchen is both stylish and practical, with generous bench space and a large island creating the perfect hub for everyday meals, entertaining and family gatherings. From here, doors open effortlessly to the deck, where a lush, leafy outlook creates a private and tranquil backdrop.\r\n\r\nAll three bedrooms are well proportioned, complemented by a modern family bathroom and a layout that makes everyday living wonderfully easy. \r\n\r\nOutside, the appeal continues. The sunny patio and established garden provide a private space for summer BBQs, entertaining friends, watching the children play or simply enjoying a quiet morning in the sunshine. A carport and generous off-street parking add practicality, while underneath the home, a spacious workshop and substantial storage area provide valuable additional space for hobbies, tools, bikes and household belongings.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally impressive. Torbay School and Long Bay College within walking distance, with Northcross Intermediate also in zone. Waiake Beach and the popular Torbay Village are just a short stroll away, while Long Bay Beach and Regional Park, Browns Bay Beach and Village are all within easy reach. Public transport at the end of the driveway and motorway connections further enhance the convenience of this sought-after coastal location.\r\n\r\nLovingly cared for and beautifully maintained by the current owners, this is a home that combines comfort, style and genuine liveability in one of Torbay's most appealing settings.\r\n\r\nWith the owners now ready to upsize, this is a wonderful opportunity to secure a home that is ready to enjoy from day one.\r\n\r\nCome along, take a look and discover why this is a home you'll want to make your own.\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
